puddle doctor (puddle 0.1.0, windows x86_64)

info  CPU virtualization    this Windows runs in a virtual machine (VMwareVMware); see Hypervisor
FAIL  Hypervisor            can't run: this is a virtual machine without nested virtualization
      fix:  This Windows is a virtual machine (VMwareVMware) whose host doesn't pass CPU
            virtualization through. Turn on nested virtualization for this VM on its host, or
            run Puddle on a physical PC. On a Hyper-V host, with the VM off:
              Set-VMProcessor -VMName <name> -ExposeVirtualizationExtensions $true
            On VMware: "Virtualize Intel VT-x/EPT or AMD-V/RVI" in the VM's processor settings.
info  Code integrity        memory integrity (HVCI) on; App Control policy for programs off
